{"ID":"20240205153806-hu225g1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153806-hu225g1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153806-hu225g1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206084201-fmosuhe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611152309-96o3sgb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1700,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611152748-5klttwa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"176狗脊（金毛狗脊）","type":"doc","updated":"20240814192500"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206084201-fmosuhe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206084201-fmosuhe","updated":"20240206084215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、福建等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈不规则的长块状，长1030cm，直径210cm。表面深棕色，残留金黄色绒毛，上面有数个红棕色的木质叶柄，下面残存黑色细根。质坚硬，不易折断。无臭，味淡、微涩。\n生狗脊片呈不规则长条形或圆形，长520cm，直径210cm，厚1.55mm；切面浅棕色，较平滑，近边缘14mm处有1条棕黄色隆起的木质部环纹或条纹，边缘不整齐，偶有金黄色绒毛残留；质脆，易折断，有粉性。\n熟狗脊片呈黑棕色，质坚硬，木质部有环纹明显。\n【性味】\t苦、甘，温。\n【功效】\t祛风除湿，补肝肾，强腰膝。用于风湿痹痛，腰膝酸软，下肢无力，尿频，遗尿，白带过多。外敷金创止血。\n【炙品】\t蒸狗脊：取净狗脊片，置笼屉内，武火蒸46h，停火后闷68h，取出，干燥。蒸狗脊苦燥之性减弱，长于补肝肾。\n酒狗脊：取净狗脊片，加黄酒拌匀，润透后置蒸笼里，武火蒸46h，停火后闷68h，取出，干燥。每100kg狗脊片用黄酒15kg。酒狗脊长于散寒止痛，通利关节。\n盐狗脊：取净狗脊片，加适量盐水拌匀，润约3h，待盐水吸尽后，蒸3h，取出晾干。盐狗脊长于益肝肾，强腰膝。\n【附注】\t金毛狗脊 (Cibotium barometz) 已被列入《濒危野生动植物种国际贸易公约》 (CITES) 附录二中。该物种虽可进行贸易，但须受许可证制度管制。"}]},{"ID":"20240206084159-ifljizf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206084159-ifljizf","updated":"20240206084159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206084159-2nkcpx6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160858-6rlobqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160858-6rlobqy","updated":"20240814190844"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 654px;","style":"width: 644px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊-20240205160858-9xvso0b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 644px;\" parent-style=\"width: 654px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240624174122-jqslm2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624174122-jqslm2p","updated":"20240814190845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 655px;","style":"width: 645px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊2-20240205160857-pu78pbs.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 645px;\" parent-style=\"width: 655px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624174003-6cdjh46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624174003-6cdjh46","updated":"20240814190846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 654px;","style":"width: 644px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊8-20240624174027-pz672e9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 644px;\" parent-style=\"width: 654px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624173111-kdkudrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624173111-kdkudrc","updated":"20240814191101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 429px;","style":"width: 419px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊-20240814191050-espumb6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 419px;\" parent-style=\"width: 429px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814191323-e2fetdv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814191323-e2fetdv","updated":"20240814191622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 641px;","style":"width: 631px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊 2-20240814191323-ym7d35g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 631px;\" parent-style=\"width: 641px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 622px;","style":"width: 612px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊 4-20240814191622-aucqjxe.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 612px;\" parent-style=\"width: 622px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814192435-x2i3vrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814192435-x2i3vrc","updated":"20240814192435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 609px;","style":"width: 599px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊-20240624173201-3guk12m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 599px;\" parent-style=\"width: 609px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 578px;","style":"width: 568px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊 5-20240814191719-hdd2zh7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 568px;\" parent-style=\"width: 578px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814190855-ga0jupo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814190855-ga0jupo","updated":"20240814191647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 588px;","style":"width: 578px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊3-20240624173400-ccs2wms.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 578px;\" parent-style=\"width: 588px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 660px;","style":"width: 650px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊 1-20240814191151-k69h88n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 650px;\" parent-style=\"width: 660px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624173201-amhrcap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624173201-amhrcap","updated":"20240814192500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 611px;","style":"width: 601px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊2-20240624173245-r5gypsg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 601px;\" parent-style=\"width: 611px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 611px;","style":"width: 601px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊 7-20240814192500-vnzd9sg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 601px;\" parent-style=\"width: 611px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624173944-9ikjsgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624173944-9ikjsgk","updated":"20240814191203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 581px;","style":"width: 571px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊7-20240624173944-nvf2j88.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 571px;\" parent-style=\"width: 581px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 652px;","style":"width: 642px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊10"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊10-20240624174108-bb34vvz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 642px;\" parent-style=\"width: 652px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814191907-kfuc3u5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814191907-kfuc3u5","updated":"20240814192412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狗脊 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狗脊 6-20240814191907-ocpzeh2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240611152511-9orv6te","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152511-9orv6te"}},{"ID":"20240611152525-r9afhf1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152525-r9afhf1","updated":"20240611152529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152525-vlvci9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152525-vlvci9w","updated":"20240611152525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152525-his88oa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152525-his88oa","updated":"20240611152525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主腰背强关机，缓急，周痹，寒湿，膝痛，颇利老人。一名百枝。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152525-r0cw0bt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152525-r0cw0bt","updated":"20240611152525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：狗脊一名狗青，一名赤节，神农苦，桐君黄帝岐伯雷公扁鹊甘无毒李氏小温，如萆薢，茎节如竹，有刺，叶圆赤，根黄白，亦如竹根，毛有刺。岐伯经云：茎长节，叶端员青赤，皮白有赤脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152525-rpeyhit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152525-rpeyhit","updated":"20240611152525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名强膂，一名扶盖，一名扶筋，生常山，二月八月，采根暴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152525-chbkwck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152525-chbkwck","updated":"20240611152525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：洁，狗脊也。玉篇云：狗脊根也。《名医》别出契条，非。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152511-15kj773","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152511-15kj773"}},{"ID":"20240611152512-p6lyp4x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152512-p6lyp4x","updated":"20240611152520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152512-k90yv2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152512-k90yv2s","updated":"20240611152512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦名强、扶筋、百枝、狗青。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152512-jpmmxjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152512-jpmmxjc","updated":"20240611152512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」苦、平、无毒（或说微温）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152512-j0m9kdj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152512-j0m9kdj","updated":"20240611152512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240611152512-vtmgfr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152512-vtmgfr2","updated":"20240611152512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、男子各种风疾。用金毛狗脊，盐泥严封煅红，取出去毛。与苏木、川乌头（生用），等分为末，加醋、糊做成丸子，如梧子大。每服地十丸，温酒盐汤送下。此方名“四宝丹”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152512-ls2sj5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152512-ls2sj5r","updated":"20240611152512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、妇女白带。用金毛狗脊（去毛）、白蔹各一两，鹿茸（酒蒸后稍焙）二两，共研为末，加艾煎醋汁，和糯米糊做成丸子，如梧子大。每服五十丸，空心服，温酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152512-sh4xudv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152512-sh4xudv","updated":"20240611152512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、固精强骨。用金毛狗脊、远志肉、茯神、当归身、等分为末，加熟蜜做成丸子，如梧子大。每服五十丸，温酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152512-3qu54kg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152512-3qu54kg","updated":"20240611152512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、病后脚肿。除节食以养胃气之外，再用狗脊煎汤浸洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152600-s25yc3h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152600-s25yc3h"}},{"ID":"20240611152601-53vpol4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152601-53vpol4","updated":"20240611152605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《神农本草经百种录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152601-huidy8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152601-huidy8s","updated":"20240611152601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。主腰背，强关机，缓急周痹，寒湿膝痛，凡邪气之在骨节间者皆能治之。颇利老人。老人精血衰，则筋骨空隙中尤不能舒展，故于此药为尤宜也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152601-64z0xwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152601-64z0xwx","updated":"20240611152601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此以形为治，狗脊遍体生毛而多节，颇似狗之脊。诸兽之中，惟狗狡捷，而此药似之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152601-9dfh7mx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152601-9dfh7mx","updated":"20240611152601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"故能入筋骨机关之际，去其凝滞寒湿之气，而使之利健强捷也。形同而性亦近，物理盖可推矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152747-pfby9ju","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152747-pfby9ju"}},{"ID":"20240611152748-5klttwa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152748-5klttwa","updated":"20240611152753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152748-w2mtosi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152748-w2mtosi","updated":"20240611152748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦甘．入足少阴经．功专强肝肾．健筋骨．得鹿茸、白蔹治带下．得川乌、萆治诸风．有黄毛如狗形．故曰金毛狗脊．去毛切．酒拌蒸．萆 焉使．"}]},{"ID":"20240611152737-8nyn7tv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152737-8nyn7tv"}},{"ID":"20240611152738-cudnc3f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152738-cudnc3f","updated":"20240611152742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152738-v4c9axq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152738-v4c9axq","updated":"20240611152738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即金毛狗脊"}]},{"ID":"20240611152738-l2cce8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152738-l2cce8b","updated":"20240611152738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"萆 为之使。恶莎草、败酱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152738-bikiviy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152738-bikiviy","updated":"20240611152738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"微苦，微温。入足少阴经气分。去风湿，疗失溺，治伤中，利关节。配当归，治病后足肿。佐鹿茸、艾，治寒湿带下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152738-dmh3vf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152738-dmh3vf9","updated":"20240611152738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"火燎去毛，切碎，酒浸蒸，取出晒干用。肾虚有火者禁用。（其性温燥。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152724-icu3sh5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152724-icu3sh5"}},{"ID":"20240611152725-orrcoi8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152725-orrcoi8","updated":"20240611152730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152725-gxf4ktu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152725-gxf4ktu","updated":"20240611152725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有二种。一根黑如狗脊骨。一生金黄毛如狗形。均入药。功用同。惟金黄毛可止刀创血。多此一效耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152725-u64bp2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152725-u64bp2c","updated":"20240611152725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治强腰背。祛风痛。利俯仰。续筋骨。周痹寒湿膝痛。四宝丹。金毛狗脊盐泥固济。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152725-5stxz88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152725-5stxz88","updated":"20240611152725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"红去毛。苏木萆生川乌各等分。研末。米醋和丸梧子大。每服二十丸。温酒或盐汤下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152725-zkuttd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152725-zkuttd7","updated":"20240611152725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治诸风疾。狗脊饮。金毛狗脊川牛膝海风藤宣木瓜桑枝松节续断杜仲秦艽桂枝熟地各一钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152725-hff8qtt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152725-hff8qtt","updated":"20240611152725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当归二两。虎骨胶一两。（不用亦可）分作五服。每服水二碗。煎至六分。绍酒一小杯同饮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152725-tal0nd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152725-tal0nd5","updated":"20240611152725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日一服。五日毕。如未愈。用酒十斤。将药泡服。治气血俱亏。兼感风湿。手足麻木。不能行动。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152712-lbiwano","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152712-lbiwano"}},{"ID":"20240611152714-5f5w8il","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152714-5f5w8il","updated":"20240611152719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152714-k73hz6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152714-k73hz6m","updated":"20240611152714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。主腰背强关机缓急。周痹寒湿。膝痛。颇利老人。一名百枝。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152714-2pu3s6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152714-2pu3s6b","updated":"20240611152714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"强扶百枝。舒拳如蕨。赤脉簇须。金茸歧骨。髀膂偾盈。筋骸超越。黄康强。清秋健鹘。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152714-k6onbz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152714-k6onbz7","updated":"20240611152714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名医曰。一名强膂。一名扶筋。李时珍曰。叶似大叶蕨。苏轼诗。韭芽戴土拳如蕨。吴普曰。叶端圆。青赤。皮白有赤脉。雷论。凡修事火燎去须。苏颂曰。根黑色。多歧。似狗脊骨。陈鉴赋。髀膂偾盈。剧谈录。田膨郎且善超越。诗。黄台背。书。身其康强。苏舜钦诗。气劲健鹘横清秋。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152641-nfw731y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152641-nfw731y"}},{"ID":"20240611152642-y1diu6h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152642-y1diu6h","updated":"20240611152647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152642-fc9af6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152642-fc9af6w","updated":"20240611152642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"《本经》名百枝"}]},{"ID":"20240611152642-kgyslcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152642-kgyslcc","updated":"20240611152642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦平微温，无毒。酒浸，炒去毛用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152642-3ygukth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152642-3ygukth","updated":"20240611152642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主腰背强，关机缓急，周痹寒湿膝痛，颇利老人。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152642-xuzwsha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152642-xuzwsha","updated":"20240611152642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊为强筋骨要药，故《本经》主腰背强周痹寒湿等疾。颇利老人者，补益肾气而坚强筋骨也。其性味形类与萆 相似，而功用亦不甚相远。四宝丹用金毛狗脊去毛，盐泥固济， 红，苏木，萆 ，川乌头生用，等分为末，醋和丸，温酒盐汤下二十丸，治男妇毒风脚软，肾气虚弱。又病后足肿煎汤洗效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152628-mft60l3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152628-mft60l3"}},{"ID":"20240611152629-dg5nl3u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152629-dg5nl3u","updated":"20240611152636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152629-8m5m300","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152629-8m5m300","updated":"20240611152629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（山草）温补肝肾以除风湿"}]},{"ID":"20240611152629-nynfdr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152629-nynfdr5","updated":"20240611152629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊（专入肝肾）。味苦甘平微温。何书既言补血。又曰去湿除风。能使脚弱腰痛失溺周痹俱治。（周痹因于风寒湿邪。在于血脉上下。寒凝汁沫。排于分肉而痛。即内经所谓内不在脏腑。外未发于皮。独居分肉之间。真气不能周。故曰周痹。）是明因其味苦。苦则能以燥湿。又因其味甘。甘则能以益血。又因其气温。温则能以补肾养气。盖湿除而气自周。气周而溺不失。血补而筋自强。筋强而风不作。是补而能走之药也。故凡一切骨节诸疾。有此药味燥入。则机关自强。而俯仰亦利。非若巴戟性兼辛散。能于风湿则直除耳。去毛。（有黄毛如狗形。故曰金毛狗脊。）切片酒蒸。萆 为使。熬膏良。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152612-5dnsdxn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152612-5dnsdxn"}},{"ID":"20240611152613-umzunjw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152613-umzunjw","updated":"20240611152618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152613-kyyik71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152613-kyyik71","updated":"20240611152613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦甘，平，微温，无毒。主腰背强，关机缓急，周痹寒湿膝痛，颇利老人，疗失溺不节，男子脚弱，腰痛风邪，淋露少气，目暗，坚脊，利俯仰，女子伤中，关节重。一名百枝，一名强膂，一名扶盖，一名扶筋。生常山川谷，二月八月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152550-ol1jgjz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152550-ol1jgjz"}},{"ID":"20240611152551-u5qw8w1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152551-u5qw8w1","updated":"20240611152555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152551-i4gi8w2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152551-i4gi8w2","updated":"20240611152551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦平，无毒。主治腰背强，机关缓急，周痹，寒湿膝痛，颇利老人。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152551-816k2m3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152551-816k2m3","updated":"20240611152551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（狗脊出常山川谷及太行山、淄青、眉州山野，处处有之。茎节如竹有刺，叶圆有赤脉，两两对生，边有锯齿，根形如狗之脊骨凸凹 ，金毛密布。李时珍曰∶狗脊有二种，一种根黑色如狗脊骨，一种有金黄毛如狗形，皆名狗脊。《本经》一名百枚，以形名也，《别录》一名强膂，一名扶筋，以功名也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152551-o3ttzfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152551-o3ttzfn","updated":"20240611152551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊根坚似骨，叶有赤脉，主利骨节而通经脉之药也。治腰背强，机关缓急，利骨节也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152551-zu2u86a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152551-zu2u86a","updated":"20240611152551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血脉不和，则为周痹，或因于寒，或因于湿，皆能为痹。治周痹寒湿，通经脉也。又曰膝痛者，言机关缓急，则膝亦痛。老人精血虚而机关不利，故颇利老人。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152536-zto3z0g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152536-zto3z0g"}},{"ID":"20240611152537-cmoftje","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152537-cmoftje","updated":"20240611152541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152537-jliailj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152537-jliailj","updated":"20240611152537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、甘，微温，无毒。主腰背强，关机缓急，周痹寒湿，膝痛，颇利老人。疗失溺不节，男子脚弱腰痛，风邪淋露，少气，目暗，坚脊，利俯仰，女子伤中，关节重。一名百枝，一名强膂，一名扶盖，一名扶筋。生常山川谷。二月、八月采根，曝干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152537-v5ya4mx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152537-v5ya4mx","updated":"20240611152537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"萆 为之使，恶败酱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152537-b14b6zp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152537-b14b6zp","updated":"20240611152537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今山野处处有，与菝 相似而小异。其茎叶小肥，其节疏，其茎大直，上有刺，叶圆有赤脉。根凹凸 如羊角细强者是。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152537-8zu00d0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152537-8zu00d0","updated":"20240611152537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此药，苗似贯众，根长多歧，状如狗脊骨，其肉作青绿色，今京下用者是。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152537-rlr1zhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152537-rlr1zhp","updated":"20240611152537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶所说，乃有刺萆 ，非狗脊也，今江左俗犹用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152459-dfi7ob0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152459-dfi7ob0"}},{"ID":"20240611152500-elclc0z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152500-elclc0z","updated":"20240611152506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152500-fy2h848","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152500-fy2h848","updated":"20240611152500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152500-gq0m3os","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152500-gq0m3os","updated":"20240611152500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】苦平，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152500-vze7uk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152500-vze7uk2","updated":"20240611152500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主腰背强，关机缓急，周痹，寒湿膝痛，颇利老人。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152500-v0x2vri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152500-v0x2vri","updated":"20240611152500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶出尝山川谷，及太行山、淄、温、眉州山野间。茎细叶花，两两相对，似大叶蕨，及贯众叶，边有锯齿，面背皆光。根形如狗脊骨，凸凹 ，金毛密布者是也。勿用透山根，其形状相似，只入顶苦不可饵。修治，火燎去毛，细锉，酒浸一夜，蒸之，从巳至申，取出晒干。先人云∶狗脊绵韧，如筋如骨，味苦性坚，而叶对生，犹脊分两胁也。能强关机者，唯精与气，体用俱备故也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152500-nlr2wcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152500-nlr2wcf","updated":"20240611152500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶此以功用立名，亦因形相类也。狗叩也，声有节，若叩物也；脊积也，积续骨节筋脉上下也。主肝肾体用，权衡形脏之关机者也。故治寒湿周痹，致关机缓急，为腰背强，及膝痛。颇利老人者，利老人之筋骨关机也。别录甄权。广关机不利于目，为目暗，不利于膀胱，失溺不节，及淋露，寒湿痹，及风虚，毒风腰强，及腰痛，膝痛，及脚弱软脚，伤中，及关节重，筋骨绝。若坚脊，即所以强肝肾，健筋骨，以利俯仰，少气，即关机失利之故也。济生方治冲任寒热，室女白带，此又广关机不利冲任与带。并可广阳维、阴维，阳跷、阴跷以及督与十二经脉经络之失利关机，则凡关机为病，为病及关机者，咸可因势而利导之。吴绶方，病后足肿，狗脊煎汤渍洗，此法金匮要略治百合病。百合煎汤洗之。百合病者，百脉之宗主为病，此筋骨脉络之关机为病也。以此推展，真不胜其用，唯在专司佐使者何如耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152423-iuerjc3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152423-iuerjc3"}},{"ID":"20240611152443-9svt640","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152443-9svt640","updated":"20240611152449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152443-u00fax5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152443-u00fax5","updated":"20240611152443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微温，无毒．主治失溺不节，男子脚弱腰痛，风邪，淋露，少气，目暗，坚脊利俯仰，女子伤中，关节重．一名强膂，一名扶盖，一名扶筋．生常山．二月、八月采根曝干．（萆 为之使，恶败酱．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152443-2jj567x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152443-2jj567x","updated":"20240611152443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶狗脊，味苦，平．主腰背强，关机缓急，周痹寒湿膝痛，颇利老人．一名百枝．生川谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240611152423-btdmug3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152423-btdmug3"}},{"ID":"20240611152424-g19nwcu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152424-g19nwcu","updated":"20240611152427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152424-zt3x2up","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152424-zt3x2up","updated":"20240611152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黑色长三四寸。形如拇脂。又似狗脊。凸凹。有硬黑须簇之。其肉青绿色。春秋采根。曝干用。又一种有金黄毛如狗形。皆可入药。勿用透山藤根。形状相似。只是入顶苦不可饵也。（）味苦甘平。气微温。苦燥湿。甘益血。温养气。是补而能走之药。入足少阴。萆为之使。恶败酱莎草。治腰背强。关机缓急。周痹寒湿膝痛。并脚弱毒风软脚。肾气虚弱。及风邪淋露。少气目暗。（濒湖谓治风虚）又女子伤中关节重。强肝肾。续筋骨。补益男子。颇利老人。并治失溺不节。主肝肾体用权衡形脏之关机者。（之颐）得牛膝菟丝地黄山萸白胶杜仲。固精强骨壮腰肾。得沉香牛膝石斛木瓜白藓皮菊花五加皮漆叶蒺藜子。能通利关节。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152424-h9a0xsz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152424-h9a0xsz","updated":"20240611152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"除五缓六急。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152424-s9ay94f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152424-s9ay94f","updated":"20240611152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕狗脊之用。在本经关机缓急一语。人身八溪。（即八虚。两肘两腋两髀两也。）为关机之室。一溪有邪气恶血住留。则伤乎经络。而上下各关机举为之不利。不利即缓急。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152424-al4b9w9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152424-al4b9w9","updated":"20240611152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夫经脉固所以利关节者也。然则关机之利。能不根治于大会之地乎。内经谓大关节在腰脊。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152424-fpbn7rg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152424-fpbn7rg","updated":"20240611152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以腰为肾府。脊乃足太阳之所行。此一脏一腑。系人身根带。而肾中冲脉。实又为经脉之海。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152424-50gwap0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152424-50gwap0","updated":"20240611152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（丹溪治人右手疼痛挛拳因湿气。以二陈加金毛狗脊杜仲川芎升麻。可知兹味宜于湿。而于阴气不足之湿乃为中病。惟经脉之海。总属于肾中冲脉。故又以之治手也。）然则八溪虽为关机之室。而腰脊尤居关节之大者。所以行血气。营阴阳。濡筋骨而利关节。胥属肾与膀胱也。即经所云肾有邪则气留于两。可知关机之室如两者。尤以肾为主矣。又如脚弱并毒风软脚。皆由大关节之处有邪气恶血留滞。故在下之经脉有伤而见于脚者。其关机不利如是耳。夫别录既言风邪淋露少气目暗。（目睛神水。固属胆汁。然化原在肾水。水郁而风木不能达之于上。故目暗。此皆经脉不利之故。以三阴经脉从下而上也。）甄权又言毒风软脚肾气虚弱。即此知狗脊之功。专主下焦肝肾之阴气。本经谓颇利老人。缘老人下焦之阴气虚。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152424-5me51xu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152424-5me51xu","updated":"20240611152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多有不利故也。抑本经但言寒湿。而别录甄权又出风邪毒风之治。有二道欤。要知肾者水脏。全藉风木以达阳而化阴。风木虚则阳不达。阳不达则阴不化。而寒湿病乎血。病乎血则风化自病而为风邪。久之为毒风。还病于肾脏而为风毒。或化为湿热以成种种肝病。皆坐风虚而已。此味能益肾气。使阳得达而阴得化。用之者主辅得宜。（病各有所因。则剂各有所主。）有何关节不利而风湿不瘳乎。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152424-ehiby29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152424-ehiby29","updated":"20240611152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缪氏云。肾虚有热。小水不利。或短涩赤黄。口舌干。皆忌。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152424-x0fupd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152424-x0fupd8","updated":"20240611152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕去毛须。锉。酒浸一夕用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152313-k5dkc94","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152313-k5dkc94"}},{"ID":"20240611152413-9fvjn96","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152413-9fvjn96","updated":"20240611152417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152413-oebhxe0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152413-oebhxe0","updated":"20240611152413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平补肝肾"}]},{"ID":"20240611152413-6a5zlfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152413-6a5zlfd","updated":"20240611152413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦坚肾，甘益血（能强汗），温养气。治失溺不节（肾虚），脚弱、腰痛、寒湿。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152413-quzp0vb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152413-quzp0vb","updated":"20240611152413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"周痹（经曰∶内不在脏腑，而外未发于皮，独居分肉之间，真气不能周，命曰周痹）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152413-kqsxz58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152413-kqsxz58","updated":"20240611152413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"除风虚，强机关，利俯仰（滋肾益肝，则骨健而筋强）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152413-f8ftfkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152413-f8ftfkc","updated":"20240611152413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有黄毛如狗形，故曰金毛狗脊。去毛，切，酒拌蒸。萆 为使。熬膏良。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152313-aq9snmf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152313-aq9snmf"}},{"ID":"20240611152359-b9393dt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152359-b9393dt","updated":"20240611152405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152359-t7wvgc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152359-t7wvgc5","updated":"20240611152359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗脊草苦甘微温，断诸疮血治痹顽，强膂坚脊利腰脚，失溺伤中补肾元。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152359-zfgxjk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152359-zfgxjk4","updated":"20240611152359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"形如狗脊，黄毛者佳，名金毛狗脊。无毒。能止诸疮血出，治周痹寒湿，膝痛脚软，腰背强痛。此药能利机关，坚筋骨，颇利老人。疗失溺不节，伤中肾虚，亦补益之剂也。恒山者胜。火燎去毛，细锉酒拌，蒸半日，晒干。萆 为使，恶败酱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152245-f5rp4bj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152245-f5rp4bj"}},{"ID":"20240611152306-g716cln","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-g716cln","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：狗脊"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-xxj0kpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-xxj0kpn","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-y4tn9gn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-y4tn9gn","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Gǒu Jǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-tsnesta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-tsnesta","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-74sbyr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-74sbyr3","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 金毛狗脊、金毛狗、金狗脊、金毛狮子、猴毛头、黄狗头"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-bybv6xk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-bybv6xk","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-f0ke35j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-f0ke35j","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" RHIZOMA CIBOTII"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-3rcm0z3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-3rcm0z3","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-hzig4lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-hzig4lf","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为蚌壳蕨科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"金毛狗脊"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cibotium barometz（L.）J.Sm.的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根茎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋、冬二季采挖，除去泥沙，干燥；或去硬根、叶柄及金黄色绒毛，切厚片，干燥，为“生狗脊片”；蒸后，晒至六、七成干，切厚片，干燥，为“熟狗脊片”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-5kip3we","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-5kip3we","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-vlgaonv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-vlgaonv","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈不规则的长块状，长10～30cm，直径2～10cm。表面深棕色，残留金黄色绒毛；上面有数个红棕色的木质叶柄，下面残存黑色细根。质坚硬，不易折断。无臭，味淡、微涩。生狗脊片呈不规则长条形或圆形，长5～20cm，直径2～10cm，厚1.5～5mm；切面浅棕色，较平滑，近边缘1～4mm处有1条棕黄色隆起的木质部环纹或条纹，边缘不整齐，偶有金黄色绒毛残留；质脆，易折断，有粉性。熟狗脊片呈黑棕色，质坚硬。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-v82qyd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-v82qyd3","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-qebj58h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-qebj58h","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处，防潮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-2mfopoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-2mfopoo","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-o1iyp49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-o1iyp49","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"狗脊"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：除去杂质；未切片者，洗净，润透，切厚片，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-5ycf97h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-5ycf97h","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"烫狗脊"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：取生狗脊片，照烫法（附录Ⅱ D）用砂烫至鼓起，放凉后除去残存绒毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-nstqfm1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-nstqfm1","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-hxifmwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-hxifmwd","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品横切面：表皮细胞1 列，残存金黄色的非腺毛。其内有10余列棕黄色厚壁细胞，壁孔明显。木质部排列成环，由管胞组成，其内外均有韧皮部及内皮层，皮层及髓，均由薄壁细胞组成，细胞充满淀粉粒，有的含黄棕色物。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-wsq309o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-wsq309o","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-4hvrlvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-4hvrlvd","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-tf1sdov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-tf1sdov","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-il54op0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-il54op0","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦、甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-9vnj5kk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-9vnj5kk","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-wlf71aa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-wlf71aa","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肝肾，强腰脊，祛风湿。用于腰膝酸软，下肢无力，风湿痹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-fzq8kxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-fzq8kxz","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-imfix67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-imfix67","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 6～12g。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-fb64569","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-fb64569","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-doplmw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-doplmw7","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-eokomk0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-eokomk0","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：狗脊"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-2gkki7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-2gkki7m","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-mkr3tyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-mkr3tyi","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Gǒu Jǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-nhdkbfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-nhdkbfi","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-6bl1m0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-6bl1m0w","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 百枝（《本经》），狗青、强膂（《吴普本草》），扶盖、扶筋（《别录》），苟脊（《本草经集注》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-rh73zjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-rh73zjk","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-rhc3fgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-rhc3fgi","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ltrh1qv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ltrh1qv","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-m54eape","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-m54eape","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蚌壳蕨科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"金毛狗"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根茎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋末冬初地上部分枯萎时采挖，除去泥砂，晒干，或削去细根、叶柄及黄色柔毛后，切片晒干者为生狗脊；如经蒸煮后，晒至六、七成干时，再切片晒干者为熟狗脊。广西、浙江等地加工时每100斤狗脊加入3～5斤黑豆皮，煮至颜色变黑后，捞出晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-vauzr54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-vauzr54","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-nuympfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-nuympfr","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于山脚沟边，或林下阴处酸性土壤。分布我国西南、南部、东南及河南、湖北等地。主产四川、福建、浙江。此外，广西、广东、贵州、江西、湖北等地亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ouyo2tv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ouyo2tv","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-asa2tvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-asa2tvy","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 金毛狗（《分类草药性》），又名：金毛狮子、三面青、猴毛头、狗仔毛、鲸口蕨、毛狗儿、金丝毛、金毛猴。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ptfr30n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ptfr30n","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生树蕨，高达2.5～3米。根茎平卧，有时转为直立，短而粗壮，带木质，密被棕黄色带有金色光泽的长柔毛。叶多数，丛生成冠状，大形；叶柄粗壮，褐色，基部密被金黄色长柔毛和黄色狭长披针形鳞片；叶片卵圆形，长可达2米，3回羽状分裂；下部羽片卵状披针形，长30～60厘米，宽15～30厘米，上部羽片逐渐短小，至顶部呈挟羽尾状：小羽片线状披针形，渐尖，羽状深裂至全裂，裂片密接，狭矩圆形或近于镰刀形，长0.5～1厘米，宽2～4毫米；亚革质，上面暗绿色，下面粉灰色，叶脉开放，不分枝。孢子囊群着生于边缘的侧脉顶上，略成矩圆形，每裂片上2～12枚，囊群盖侧裂呈双唇状，棕褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-n0a70nh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-n0a70nh","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-undox13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-undox13","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 金毛狗脊（《本草备要》），又名：金狗脊（《职方典》），黄狗脊（《分类卑药性））。根茎呈不规则的长块状，长8～18厘米，直径3～7厘米。外附光亮的金黄色长柔毛，上部有几个棕红色木质的叶柄，中部及下部丛生多数棕黑色细根。质坚硬，难折断。气无，味淡，微涩。狗脊片呈不规则长形，圆形或长椭圆形。纵切片长约6～20厘米，宽3～5厘米；横切片直径2.5～5厘米，厚2～5毫米，边缘均不整齐。生狗脊片表面有时有未去尽的金黄色柔毛；在近外皮约3～5毫米处，有一圈凸出的明显内皮层（纵片之圈多不连贯），表面近于深棕色，平滑，细腻，内部则为浅棕色，较粗糙，有粉性。热狗脊片为黑棕色或棕黄色，其他与生者相同。以片厚薄均匀、坚实无毛、不空心者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-6l75fs6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-6l75fs6","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-xp7q5rr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-xp7q5rr","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 金毛狗脊根茎含淀粉30％左右。狗脊蕨根茎含淀粉高达48.5％，并含鞣质类。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-fwq51qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-fwq51qw","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-q6rwwc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-q6rwwc9","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取砂子置锅内炒至轻松，加入拣净的狗脊，用武火炒至鼓起并显深黄色，取出，筛除砂子，风晾后，撞去或刮净黄绒毛。或将原药刮云毛后用清水浸12小时，放入蒸笼内蒸一天，焖一夜，制黑为度，上下翻一翻再蒸一天，焖一夜，取出晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-lw35e9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-lw35e9n","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮炙沦》：\"凡修事狗脊，细锉丁，酒拌，蒸，从巳至申出，晒干用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-zi05glx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-zi05glx","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"狗脊，今人惟锉炒去毛须用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-t33u97j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-t33u97j","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-u35t95s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-u35t95s","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-tnoyr6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-tnoyr6z","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肾、膀胱二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-er95d1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-er95d1q","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草求真》：\"入肝、肾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ft1nnp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ft1nnp9","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》：\"入心、肝、肾三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ycaozhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ycaozhl","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ar7r6le","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ar7r6le","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-hv0e48w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-hv0e48w","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-rsyqoey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-rsyqoey","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"桐君、黄帝、岐伯、雷公、扁鹊：甘，无毒。李氏：温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-tublmrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-tublmrh","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》；\"味苦辛，微热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-4ps5idc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-4ps5idc","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-pqi2vod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-pqi2vod","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 阴虚有热，小便不利者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-15pzyfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-15pzyfi","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"萆薢为之使，恶败酱。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-mor707c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-mor707c","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"肾虚有热，小水不利或短涩赤黄，口苦舌干皆忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-n3hkwhg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-n3hkwhg","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草汇言》：\"肝虚有郁火忌用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-bknzmmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-bknzmmy","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-sr4hvu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-sr4hvu8","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肝肾，除风湿，健腰脚，利关节。治腰背酸疼，膝痛脚弱，寒湿周痹，失溺，尿频，遗精，白带。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-nsg5w2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-nsg5w2b","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主腰背强，机关缓急，周痹寒湿，膝痛。颇利老人。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ofjize6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ofjize6","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗失溺不节，男子脚弱腰痛，风邪淋露，少气目闇，坚脊，利俯仰，女子伤中，关节重。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-kja2ciw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-kja2ciw","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"治男子女人毒风软脚，邪气湿痹，肾气虚弱，补益男子，纹筋骨。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-7utz9gp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-7utz9gp","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"强肝肾，健骨，治风虚。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ogrhgin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ogrhgin","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《玉楸药解》：\"泄湿去寒，起痿止痛，泄肾肝湿气，通关利窍，强筋壮骨，治腰痛膝疼，足肿腿弱，遗精带浊。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-0z0znf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-0z0znf4","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目拾遗》：\"金狗脊止诸疮血出，治顽痹，黑色者杀虫更效。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ac2uwgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ac2uwgk","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草再新》：\"坚肾养血，补气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-9t57irt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-9t57irt","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《南宁市药物志》：\"治跌打腰痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-yfbzrgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-yfbzrgr","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-3d18du7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-3d18du7","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱；熬膏或入丸剂。外用：煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-nxxefzv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-nxxefzv","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-8qsq2rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-8qsq2rj","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治五种腰痛，利脚膝：狗脊二两，萆薢二两（锉），兔丝子一两（酒浸三日，曝干别捣）。上药捣罗为末，炼蜜和丸，如梧桐子大。每日空心及晚食前服三十丸，以新萆薢渍酒二七日，取此酒下药。（《圣惠方》狗脊丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-0ja6ne8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-0ja6ne8","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治男女一切风疾：金毛狗脊（盐泥固济，火煅红，去毛用肉，出火气，剉）、萆薢、苏木节、川乌头（生用）。上各等分，为细末，米醋糊为丸，如梧桐子大，每服二十丸，温酒或盐汤下。病在上，食后服；病在下，空心服。（《普济方》四宝丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-3w61cnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-3w61cnn","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治风湿骨痛、腰膝无力：金毛狗脊根茎六钱，香樟根、马鞭草各四钱，杜仲、续断各五钱，铁脚威灵仙三钱，红牛膝二钱。泡酒服。（《贵州草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-xf9yoc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-xf9yoc3","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④固精强骨：金毛狗脊、远志肉、白茯神、当归身等分。为末，炼蜜丸，梧子大。每酒服五十丸。（《濒湖集简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-g30po1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-g30po1r","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治病后足肿：用狗脊煎汤渍洗。并节食以养胃气。（《伤寒蕴要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-uqsyf47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-uqsyf47","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治腰痛及小便过多：金毛狗脊、木瓜、五加皮、杜仲。煎服。（《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-wjtlblz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-wjtlblz","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治年老尿多：金毛狗脊根茎、大夜关门、蜂糖罐根、小棕根各五钱。炖猪肉吃。（《贵州草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-z7obsne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-z7obsne","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治室女冲任虚寒、带下纯白：鹿茸（醋蒸，焙）二两，白蔹、金毛狗脊（燎去毛）各一两。上为细末，用艾煎醋汁，打糯米糊为丸，如桐子大。每服五十丸，空心温酒下。（《普济方》白蔹丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ohh0mj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ohh0mj6","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ds6g7xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ds6g7xr","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经疏》：\"狗脊，苦能燥湿，甘能益血，温能养气，是补而能走之药也。肾虚则腰背强，机关有缓急之病，滋肾益气血，则腰背不强，机关无缓急之患矣。周痹寒湿膝痛者，肾气不足，而为风寒湿之邪所中也，兹得补则邪散痹除而膝亦利矣。老人肾气衰乏，肝血亦虚，则筋骨不健，补肾入骨，故利老人也。失溺不节，肾气虚脱故也。《经》曰，腰者肾之府，动摇不能，肾将惫矣。此腰痛亦指肾虚而为湿邪所乘者言也。气血不足，则风邪乘虚客之也。淋露者，肾气与带脉冲任俱虚所致也。少气者，阳虚也。目得血而能视，水旺则瞳子精明，肝肾俱虚，故目闇。女子伤中，关节重者，血虚兼有湿也，除湿益肾，则诸病自寥，脊坚则俯仰自利矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-p8q1aar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-p8q1aar","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草述》：\"《本经》于狗脊主治，首云腰背，次乃及机关缓急，更次乃及膝也，岂非知所先后哉。又如疗脚弱，并毒风软脚，皆由大关节之处，有留滞邪气恶血，故在下部之经脉有伤，而见于脚者，其机关不利如是耳。然则狗脊主气乎?主血乎?夫其所治，《别录》言风邪淋露，少气目闇。甄权又言毒风软脚，肾气虚弱，即此可以思其功。夫经脉所以濡筋骨、利机关，非血无以濡之，非气无以呴之。故此味乃主下焦肝肾之阴气，与上焦心肺之阳气微不同耳。《本经》谓颇利老人，缘老人下焦之阴气多虚，多有不利故也。更绎《本经》但言寒湿，而《别录》、甄权又出风邪毒风之治，非有二也。盖肾者水脏，全藉风木以达阳而化阴；风木虚，则阳不达，阳不达，则阴不化，阴不化，则寒湿病乎血，病乎血则风化自病而为风邪，久之为毒风，还病于肾脏，而为肾脏风毒。或有化为湿热，以为肝种种之病者，皆坐风虚也。此味能益肾气，若主辅得宜，使阳得达而阴得化，有何关节不利而风湿不廖乎。但病各有所因，则剂各有所主，诚即方书治寒湿脚气，必用益阳气、除寒湿之剂；治风湿，必用活血、除风湿之剂，而此特逐队以奏功。又有脚气宜补心肾者，主以益心肾之味，而此特佐之。然则此味固不任攻击之功，即冀其奏补益之效，亦未能专恃也矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-cx3gnrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-cx3gnrh","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草求真》：\"狗脊，何书既言补血滋水，又曰去湿除风，能使脚弱、腰痛、失溺，周痹俱治，是明因其味苦，苦则能以燥湿；又因其味甘，甘则能以益血；又因其气温，温则能以补肾养气。盖湿除而气自周，气周而溺不失，血补而筋自强，筋强而风不作，是补而能走之药也。故凡一切骨节诸疾，有此药味燥入，则关节自强，而俯仰亦利，非若巴戟性兼辛散，能于风湿则直除耳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-on4ta23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-on4ta23","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本经续疏》：\"狗脊，《本经》所主机关缓急，冠于周痹之前，而寒湿膝痛，系于周痹之后，以明寒湿膝痛之非周痹，惟机关缓急乃为周痹，而腰背强则狗脊之主证，为两病之所均有也。此《本经》之最明析周详，遥应《灵枢·周痹篇》黍铢无漏者也。虽然，味苦气平，则性专主降。惟其苦中有甘，平而微温，乃为降中有升。降中有升，是以下不能至地，本专主降，是以上不能至天，而盘旋于中下之际。为活利之所凭藉，非补虚亦非泄邪，有邪者能活利，无邪者亦能活利，是以颇利老人句，著于周痹膝痛两证之外，以见其不专治邪耳。其《别录》以疗失溺不节，更治男女有异何也?盖溺虽出于膀胱，而启闭由于肾，启闭之以时，犹关节之以利，利者过利，必有不利者过于不利，利者以时，则不利者利矣；所以然者，肾固主藏五脏六腑之精而敷布于周身百节者也，故以启闭之机关，可验屈伸之机关，以屈伸之机关，可揣启闭之机关，用是知狗脊所治之失溺不节，必机关有倔强之萌者矣。治痿者独取阳明，阳明者主宗筋，宗筋主束骨而利机关，病涉宗筋，男女自应有别。脚弱俯仰不利，痿之似而缓急之根，关节重则痹之似而亦缓急之根，其源于湿一也。特宗筋纵者，其病也疾，宗筋缩者，其病也徐。故男子用狗脊，遇弱而无力，即应投之。女子用狗脊，虽至关节已重可也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-bpdv1o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-bpdv1o3","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草正义》：\"狗脊本有二种，一种似狗之脊骨，古之所用也；一种有金毛而极似狗形，今谓之为金毛狗脊，濒湖《纲目》已备载之，赵氏《拾遗》据《职方典》谓出于粤西之南宁府，即蕨根也。今之所用，皆即此种，能温养肝肾，通调百脉，强腰膝，坚脊骨，利关节，而驱痹著，起痿废，又能固摄冲带，坚强督任，疗治女子经带淋露，功效甚宏，诚虚弱衰老恒用之品。且温而不燥，走而不泄，尤为有利无弊，颇有温和中正气象，而人多忽之，不以为重，殊可惜也。\"\"缪氏《经疏》谓肾虚有热，小水不利，或短涩赤黄，口苦舌干者忌用，盖以其性温而示之禁例也。然狗脊性温，乃温和温养之用，非温热温燥之例，如果肝肾之虚，阴不涵阳，以此固摄下元，引经向导。亦无不可。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-gd69o7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-gd69o7x","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-5yajxi7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-5yajxi7","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 此外，鳞毛蕨科植物的根茎，在陕西地区亦作狗脊入药，当地习称\"黑狗脊\"。干品状如狗脊骨，无金黄色绒毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ho0e85b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ho0e85b","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《植物名实图考》所载，系乌毛蕨科植物狗脊蕨。其根茎在湖南、江西、广西亦有作狗脊使用者。在华东、华南及四川等地则作为贯众入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ze2jswo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ze2jswo","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-qqtg9t8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-qqtg9t8","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-y8tkpfx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-y8tkpfx","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：狗脊"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-1qf5f7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-1qf5f7l","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-5e3j5mo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-5e3j5mo","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Gǒu Jǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-v4xgp3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-v4xgp3k","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-p9ltdb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-p9ltdb7","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 百枝、狗青、强膂、扶盖、扶筋、苟脊、金毛狗脊、金狗脊、黄狗头、金毛狮子、毛狗儿、金丝毛、金扶筋、金猫咪、老猴毛"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-o97k81b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-o97k81b","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-m03x3p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-m03x3p3","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" East Asian Tree Fern Rhizome， Rhizome of East Asian Tree Fern， Rhizome of Scythian Lamb"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-0pg2pph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-0pg2pph","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-o0vgp4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-o0vgp4v","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-pqrrfmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-pqrrfmx","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《名医别录》：狗脊，生常山川谷。二月、八月采根，曝干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-wxmxk3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-wxmxk3y","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《唐本草》：此药（狗脊）苗似贯众，根长多歧，状如狗脊骨，其肉作青绿色，今京下用者是。陶所说乃有刺萆，非狗脊也，今江左俗犹用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-guohjyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-guohjyy","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草图经》：狗脊，今太行山、淄、温、眉州亦有。根黑色，长三、四寸，两指许大；苗头细碎，青色，高一尺已来；无花；其茎叶似贯众而细，其根长而多歧似狗脊骨，故以名之。其"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-l359z21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-l359z21","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ttihxnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ttihxnt","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蚌壳蕨科植物金毛狗的根茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-hea3snh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-hea3snh","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Cibotium barometz(L.)J.Smith[Polypodium barometz L.]"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-flp7al2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-flp7al2","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋、冬两季采挖，除去泥沙，干燥；或去硬根、叶柄及金黄色绒毛，切厚片，干燥，为“生狗脊片”；水煮或蒸后，晒至六七成干，切厚片，干燥，为“熟狗脊片”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-630kiu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-630kiu7","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-tr3mo06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-tr3mo06","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于山脚沟边及林下阴处酸性土上。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-d7tz42d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-d7tz42d","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于华南、西南及浙江、江西、福建、台湾、湖南。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-y86srcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-y86srcm","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-q0cub5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-q0cub5r","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生树蕨，高达2.5-3m。根茎平卧，有时转为直立，短而粗壮，带木质，密被棕黄色带有金色光泽的长柔毛。叶多数，丛生成冠状，大形；叶柄粗壮，褐色，基部密被金黄色长柔毛和黄色狭长披针形鳞片；叶片卵圆形，长可达2m，3回羽状分裂；下部羽片卵状披针形，长30-60cm，宽15-30cm，上部羽片逐渐短小，至顶部呈狭羽尾状；小羽片线状披针形，渐尖，羽状深裂至全裂，裂片密接，狭矩圆形或近于镰刀形，长0.5-1cm，宽2-4mm；亚革质，上面暗绿色，下面粉灰色，叶脉开放，不分枝。孢子囊群着生于边缘的侧脉顶上，略成矩圆形，每裂片上2-12枚，囊群盖侧裂呈双唇状，棕褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-49sccra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-49sccra","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-enj8fkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-enj8fkv","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.性状鉴别 根茎呈不规则的长块状，长10-30cm，直径2-10cm。表面深棕色，密被光亮的金黄色茸毛，上部有数个棕红色叶柄残基，下部丛生多数棕黑色细根。质坚硬，难折断。气无，味微涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-v8zof9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-v8zof9r","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）生狗脊片 呈不规则长条形或圆形纵片，长5-20cm，宽2-8cm，厚1.5-5mm；周边不整齐，外表深棕色，偶有未去尽的金黄色茸毛；断面浅棕色，近外皮2-5mm处有1条凸起的棕黄色木质部环纹或条纹。质坚硬，易折断。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ic5wcsb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ic5wcsb","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）熟狗脊片 全体呈黑棕色，木质部环纹明显。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-sdjuhhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-sdjuhhi","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原药材以肥大、质坚实无空心、外表略有金黄色茸毛者为佳。狗脊片以厚薄均匀、坚实无毛、不空心者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-qnu0gn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-qnu0gn0","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.显微鉴别 根茎横切面：表皮细胞1列，外被非腺毛，黄棕色。厚壁细胞10-20列，黄棕色，壁孔明显，内含淀粉粒。双韧管状中柱，木质部由数列管胞组成，其内外均有韧皮部及内皮层。皮层及髓部较宽，无为薄壁细胞，内含淀粉粒或黄棕色物质。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-0d5nnhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-0d5nnhf","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶柄基部横切面：分体中柱多呈“U”形，30余个断续排列成双钩状。木质部居中，外围为韧皮部、内皮层。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-dudmjer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-dudmjer","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-inzgsea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-inzgsea","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含蕨素（pterosin）R，金粉蕨素（onitin），金粉蕨素-2'-O-葡萄糖甙（onitin-2'-O-β-D-glucoside），金粉蕨素-2'-O-阿洛糖甙（onitin-2'-O-β-D-alloside），欧蕨伊鲁甙（ptaquiloside），蕨素Z。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-pgq3e5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-pgq3e5r","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-hew6gk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-hew6gk7","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 100%狗脊注射液给小鼠腹腔注射30g/kg，对心肌摄取86Rb无明显改变。如连续14d给20g/kg，心肌对86Rb的摄取可增加54%，有明显增加。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-plu7ymx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-plu7ymx","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-u30nvku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-u30nvku","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取沙子置锅内炒至轻松，加入拣净的狗脊，用武火炒至鼓起并显深黄色，取出，筛除沙子，风晾后，撞去或刮净黄绒毛。或将原药刮去毛后用清水浸12小时，放入蒸笼内蒸一天，焖一夜，制黑为度，上下翻一翻再蒸一天，焖一夜，取出晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-t8bskuc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-t8bskuc","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-3e5gu4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-3e5gu4u","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.取生狗脊药材折断，在紫外灯（254nm）下观察，断面显淡紫色荧光，凸起的木质部环显黄色荧光。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-xk8uvlo","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-xk8uvlo","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611152306-lbtnw5g","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-lbtnw5g","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611152306-42ekrf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-42ekrf1","updated":"20240611152306"}}]}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-gh4lr8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-gh4lr8a","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.（检查酚类）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-jlyg3zg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-jlyg3zg","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-4kfbcyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-4kfbcyq","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；肾；心；膀胱经"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-vqu2o8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-vqu2o8v","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-he3fo5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-he3fo5i","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦；甘；温"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-a8vtfn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-a8vtfn2","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-5lolawr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-5lolawr","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肾虚有热，小水不利或短涩赤黄，口苦舌干皆忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-vnk0o5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-vnk0o5d","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-nes5f5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-nes5f5l","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除风湿；健腰脚；利关节。主肾虚腰痛脊强；足膝软弱无力；风湿痹痛；尿频；遗精；白带过多"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-xnttaxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-xnttaxi","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-f46uc2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-f46uc2e","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，10-15g；或浸酒。外用：适量，鲜口捣烂敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-enlb35x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-enlb35x","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-dpyurdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-dpyurdt","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 狗脊丸《太平圣惠方》；四宝丹《普济本事方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-fqd1mde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-fqd1mde","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-9w64j9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-9w64j9c","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草经疏》：狗脊，苦能燥湿，甘能益血，温能养气，是补而能走之药也。肾虚则腰背强，机关有缓急之病，滋肾益气血，则腰背不强，机关无缓急之患矣。周痹寒湿膝痛者，肾气不足，而为风寒湿之邪所中也，兹得补则邪散痹除而膝亦利矣。老人肾气衰乏，肝血亦虚，则筋骨不健，补肾入骨，故利老人也。失溺不节，肾气虚脱故也。《经》曰，腰者肾之府，动摇不能，肾将惫矣。此腰痛亦指肾虚而为湿邪所乘者言也。气血不足，则风邪乘虚客之也。淋露者，肾气与带脉冲任俱虚所致也。少气者，阳虚也。目得血而能视，水旺则瞳子精明，肝肾俱虚，故目AN。女子伤中，关节重者，血虚兼有湿也，除湿益肾，则诸病自瘳，脊坚则俯仰自利矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ojnm5zn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ojnm5zn","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草述》：《本经》于狗脊主治，首云腰背，次乃及机关缓急，更次乃及膝也，岂非知所先后哉。又如疗脚弱，并毒风软脚，皆由大关节之处，有留滞邪气恶血，故在下部之经脉有伤，而见于脚者，其机关不利如是耳。然则狗脊主气乎？主血乎？夫其所治，《别录》言风邪淋露，少气目暗。甄权又言毒风软脚，肾气虚弱，即此可以思其功。夫经脉所以濡筋骨、利机关，非血无以濡之，非气无以XV之。故此味乃主下焦肝肾之阴气，与上焦心肺之阳气微不同耳。《本经》谓颇利老人，缘老人下焦之阴气多虚，多有不利故也。更绎《本经》但言寒湿，而《别录》、甄权又出风邪毒风之治，非有二也。盖肾者水脏，全藉风木以达阳而化阴；风木虚，则阳不达，阳不达，则阴不化，阴不化，则寒湿病乎血，病乎血则风化自病而为风邪，久之为毒风，还病于肾脏，而为肾脏风毒。或有化为湿热，以为肝种种之病者，皆坐风虚也。此味能益肾气，若主辅得宜，使阳得达而阴得化，有何关节不利而风湿不瘳乎。但病各有所因，则剂各有所主，诚即方书治寒湿脚气，必用益阳气、除寒湿之剂；治风湿，必用活血、除风湿之剂，而此特逐队以奏功。又有脚气宜补心肾者，主以益心肾之味，而此特佐之。然则此味固不任攻击之功，即冀其奏补益之效，亦未能专恃也矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-frh1ahr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-frh1ahr","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草求真》：狗脊，何书既言补血滋水，又曰去湿除风，能使脚弱、腰痛、失溺、周痹俱治，是明因其味苦，苦则能以燥湿；又因其味甘，甘则能以益血；又因其气温，温则能以补肾养气。盖湿除而气自周，气周而溺不失，血补而筋自强，筋强而风不作，是补而能走之药也。故凡一切骨节诸疾，有此药味燥入，则关节自强，而俯仰亦利，非若巴戟性兼辛散，能于风湿则直除耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-mbbeg3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-mbbeg3c","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本经续疏》：狗脊，《本经》所主机关缓急，冠于周痹之前，而寒湿膝痛，系于周痹之后，以明寒湿膝痛之非周痹，惟机关缓急乃为周痹，而腰背强则狗脊之主证，为两病之所均有也。此《本经》之最明析周详，遥应《灵枢·周痹篇》黍铢无漏者也。虽然，味苦气平，则性专主降。惟其苦中有甘，平而微温，乃为降中有升。降中有升，是以下不能至地，本专主降，是以上不能至天，而盘旋于中下之际。为活利之所凭藉，非补虚亦非泄邪，有邪者能活利，无邪者亦能活利，是以颇利老人句，着于周痹膝痛两证之外，以见其不专治邪耳。其《别录》以疗失溺不节，更治男女有异何也？盖溺虽出于膀胱，而启闭由于肾，启闭之以时，犹关节之以利，利者过利，必有不利者过于不利，利者以时，则不利者利矣；所以然者，肾固主藏五脏六腑之精而敷布于周身百节者也，故以启闭之机关，可验屈伸之机关，以屈伸之机关，可揣启闭之机关，用是知狗脊所治之失溺不节，必机关有倔强之萌者矣。治痿者独取阳明，阳明者主宗筋，宗筋主束骨而利机关，病涉宗筋，男女自应有别。脚弱俯仰不利，痿之似而缓急之根，关节重则痹之似而亦缓急之根，其源于湿一也。特宗筋纵者，其病也疾，宗筋缩者，其病也徐。故男子用狗脊，遇弱而无力，即应投之。女子用狗脊，虽至关节已重可也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-09tx7do","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-09tx7do","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草正义》：狗脊本有二种，一种似狗之脊骨，古之所用也；一种有金毛而极似狗形，今谓之为金毛狗脊，濒湖《纲目》已备载之，赵氏《拾遗》据《职方典》谓出于粤西之南宁府，即蕨根也。今之所用，皆即此种，能温养肝肾，通调百脉，强腰膝，坚脊骨，利关节，而驱痹着，起痿废，又能固摄冲带，坚强督任，疗治女子经带淋露，功效甚宏，诚虚弱衰老恒用之品。且温而不燥，走而不泄，尤为有利无弊，颇有温和中正气象，而人多忽之，不以为重，殊可惜也。缨氏《经疏》谓肾虚有热，小水不利，或短涩赤黄，口苦舌干者忌用，盖以其性温而示之禁例也。然狗脊性温，乃温和温养之用，非温热温燥之例，如果肝肾之虚，阴不涵阳，以此固摄下元，引经向导。亦无不可。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-oe5m2u5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-oe5m2u5","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《神农本草经》：主腰背强，机关缓急，周痹寒湿，膝痛。颇利老人。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-j3w7mhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-j3w7mhy","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《名医别录》：疗失溺不节，男子脚弱腰痛，风邪淋露，少气目眩，坚脊，利俯仰，女子伤中，关节重。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-owbd4mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-owbd4mc","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《药性论》：治男子女人毒风软脚，邪气湿痹，肾气虚弱，补益男子，续筋骨。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-69v3djr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-69v3djr","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《本草纲目》：强肝肾，健骨，治风虚。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-3erys5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-3erys5w","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《玉楸药解》：泄湿去寒，起痿止痛，泄肾肝湿气，通关利窍，强筋壮骨，治腰痛膝疼，足肿腿弱，遗精带浊。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-cv5h8r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-cv5h8r1","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本草纲目拾遗》：金狗脊止诸疮血出，治顽痹，黑色者杀虫更效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-1edta9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-1edta9u","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《本草再新》：坚肾养血，补气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-ax823sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-ax823sa","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.《南宁市药物志》：治跌打腰痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-nbsb0ln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-nbsb0ln","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611152306-7srmeg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152306-7srmeg3","updated":"20240611152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152308-tlxth8v","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152308-tlxth8v"}},{"ID":"20240611152309-96o3sgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152309-96o3sgb"}}]}